---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="QMS 功能特点 | 七木数播 QMS Audio OS"
    description="七木数播 QMS Audio OS 功能特点：DSD Native / DoP 双模源码直出、SACD ISO 原盘直播、全场景音源融合、6 档名胆调音与 10 段 EQ、4 款发烧主题、AirPlay / DLNA 双向投流。"
    currentPath="/qms-features"
>
    <section id="qms-features-view" class="page-view">
        <div class="section-container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <h1 class="section-title">功能特点</h1>
                <p class="section-subtitle">每一个功能，都为极致音质而生</p>
            </div>

            <div class="qms-features-grid">
                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="17" />
                            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="6" />
                            <line x1="24" y1="3" x2="24" y2="11" />
                            <line x1="24" y1="37" x2="24" y2="45" />
                            <line x1="3" y1="24" x2="11" y2="24" />
                            <line x1="37" y1="24" x2="45" y2="24" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>DSD Native / DoP 双模源码直出</h3>
                    <p>纯 C 语言 Zero-Copy 推流架构，Bit-Perfect 原生直通 ALSA 硬件层。完美适配 Amanero (384kHz)、XMOS (768kHz) 等异步 USB DAC，支持 Native DSD512 直解与 1-bit 智能降采样兼容。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>DSD64 - DSD512</span><span>PCM 768kHz</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="17" />
                            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
                            <path d="M24 12a12 12 0 0 1 10 18" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>SACD ISO / CUE 原盘免解压直播</h3>
                    <p>无需繁琐解压超大镜像文件，内存扇区级直解 SACD ISO 原盘与整轨 CUE 虚拟分轨，精准融合中文 XML 元数据与专辑封面，支持子曲目瞬时展开与毫秒级切歌。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>ISO 原盘</span><span>CUE 分轨</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <path d="M12 30a12 12 0 0 1 24 0" />
                            <path d="M18 30a6 6 0 0 1 12 0" />
                            <circle cx="24" cy="30" r="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
                            <line x1="24" y1="32" x2="24" y2="44" />
                            <line x1="18" y1="44" x2="30" y2="44" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>全场景本地 / NAS / 云盘融合</h3>
                    <p>支持机内 SSD/USB 即插即扫、局域网 SMB/NFS 智能发现挂载与拖拽传歌；内置百度、阿里云盘、夸克、115、WebDAV 云端直出，以及网易云音乐扫码登录。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>本地</span><span>NAS</span><span>5大云盘</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="38" y2="14" />
                            <line x1="10" y1="24" x2="38" y2="24" />
                            <line x1="10" y1="34" x2="38" y2="34" />
                            <circle cx="19" cy="14" r="3" fill="var(--bg-card)" />
                            <circle cx="29" cy="24" r="3" fill="var(--bg-card)" />
                            <circle cx="15" cy="34" r="3" fill="var(--bg-card)" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>6 档传奇名胆调音 &amp; 10 段录音室 EQ</h3>
                    <p>提供纯直通 Bypass 与 300B、KT88、ECC83、2A3、EL34 五大经典电子管偶次谐波仿真毫秒热切换；配备 64-bit 浮点 IIR 10 段专业均衡器（31.25Hz–16kHz）与防削波余量控制。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>6 档名胆</span><span>10 段 EQ</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <rect x="8" y="8" width="32" height="32" rx="4" />
                            <line x1="8" y1="20" x2="40" y2="20" />
                            <line x1="20" y1="20" x2="20" y2="40" />
                            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
                            <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="4" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>4 款发烧质感主题 &amp; PC / 手机双端控台</h3>
                    <p>内置黑曜石、黑胡桃、暖橡木、银拉丝四款精密硬件美学主题；PC 三栏专业调音台搭配实时 1024 点 FFT 频谱与麦景图双表头，手机触控端同步掌控黑胶视觉与歌单。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>4 种主题</span><span>双端控台</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M14 18 L30 24 L14 30 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
                            <path d="M34 16a10 10 0 0 1 0 16" />
                            <path d="M38 12a16 16 0 0 1 0 24" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>AirPlay / DLNA 双向投流 &amp; 音乐播不停</h3>
                    <p>既可作高清接收端无损接管手机/平板音乐投屏，也能向客厅音响与 Daphile 反向推流；搭载主机端「音乐播不停」无感续航、跨端自建歌单与 LRC 动态歌词滚动。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>双向投流</span><span>无感续播</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <rect x="12" y="12" width="24" height="24" rx="3" />
                            <rect x="20" y="20" width="8" height="8" />
                            <line x1="18" y1="12" x2="18" y2="6" />
                            <line x1="24" y1="12" x2="24" y2="6" />
                            <line x1="30" y1="12" x2="30" y2="6" />
                            <line x1="18" y1="42" x2="18" y2="36" />
                            <line x1="24" y1="42" x2="24" y2="36" />
                            <line x1="30" y1="42" x2="30" y2="36" />
                            <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="6" y2="18" />
                            <line x1="12" y1="30" x2="6" y2="30" />
                            <line x1="42" y1="18" x2="36" y2="18" />
                            <line x1="42" y1="30" x2="36" y2="30" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>PREEMPT_RT 纯血实时声学内核</h3>
                    <p>提供专为极客发烧友打造的 Linux PREEMPT_RT 实时内核版本，大幅压缩系统调度延迟与时间抖动（Jitter），并支持与标准版/达菲（Daphile）双系统互切。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>PREEMPT_RT 实时内核</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M24 6 L40 12 V24 C40 33 33 40 24 43 C15 40 8 33 8 24 V12 Z" />
                            <path d="M17 24 L22 29 L31 19" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>发烧纯净极简模式 &amp; 硬件级静音防爆音</h3>
                    <p>一键进入极简纯净听音模式，关闭冗余常驻流媒体后台并释放 200MB+ 内存资源；配合开机防爆音硬件静音守护、USB DAC 热插拔即刻重连与 ACPI 电源按键防抖关机。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>极简纯净</span><span>硬件守护</span></div>
                </article>

                <article class="qms-feature-card">
                    <div class="qms-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M40 24a16 16 0 1 1-5-11.7" />
                            <path d="M40 6v9h-9" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>全能扩展与双槽位无感升级</h3>
                    <p>支持 Live U 盘一键无损装机至机内 NVMe/SATA 硬盘，自带无线 Wi-Fi 2.4G/5G 配网与 A/B 安全双槽位系统升级机制，持续稳定演进，守护珍贵监听系统。</p>
                    <div class="qms-feature-tags"><span>一键装机</span><span>安全升级</span></div>
                </article>
            </div>

            <div class="qms-params">
                <h2 class="sub-section-title">技术参数</h2>
                <dl class="qms-params-list">
                    <div><dt>音频格式</dt><dd>DSF / DFF / SACD ISO / FLAC / WAV / APE / AIFF / ALAC / M4A / MP3 / CUE 虚拟分轨</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>DSD</dt><dd>Native DSD64–DSD512 / DoP，内建 1-bit Sigma-Delta 降采样兼容</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>PCM</dt><dd>最高 768kHz 异步 USB 直通（XMOS 768kHz、Amanero Combo384 384kHz）</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>10 段 EQ 频点</dt><dd>31.25Hz / 62.5Hz / 125Hz / 250Hz / 500Hz / 1kHz / 2kHz / 4kHz / 8kHz / 16kHz（±12dB）</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>名胆仿真</dt><dd>Bypass 纯直通 / 300B / KT88 / ECC83·12AX7 / 2A3 / EL34</dd></div>
                    <div><dt>音源与投流</dt><dd>SMB / NFS 自动发现挂载；百度、阿里、夸克、115、WebDAV；网易云音乐扫码登录；AirPlay 接收、DLNA 双向、Daphile 发现与推流</dd></div>
                </dl>
            </div>

            <div class="qms-cta">
                <h2>七木数播 QMS Audio OS</h2>
                <p class="qms-cta-pricing"><strong>Pro ¥299 / 永久</strong><span class="qms-cta-sep">·</span><strong>RT ¥599 / 永久</strong><span class="qms-cta-sep">·</span>免费试用 3 天</p>
                <p class="qms-cta-note">Pro 老用户补 300 升 RT（首发限时至 11 月 30 日）。</p>
                <div class="hero-buttons qms-cta-buttons">
                    <a href="/blog/qms-v7-1-0-launch" class="btn btn-primary">查看 7.1.0 发布文章 &rarr;</a>
                    <a href="https://wx.284868.xyz/qms-auth/" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">自助激活中心</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .qms-features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 24px;
        margin: 32px 0 48px;
    }
    .qms-feature-card {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 32px 28px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }
    .qms-feature-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }
    .qms-feature-icon {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border: 2px solid #d4a017;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #d4a017;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .qms-feature-icon svg {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
    }
    .qms-feature-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }
    .qms-feature-card p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        flex: 1;
    }
    .qms-feature-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
    }
    .qms-feature-tags span {
        background: rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.12);
        color: #b08a1a;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.25);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .qms-params {
        margin: 0 0 48px;
    }
    .qms-params-list {
        margin: 20px 0 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .qms-params-list > div {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 14px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .qms-params-list dt {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }
    .qms-params-list dd {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .qms-cta {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.4);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 36px 28px;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .qms-cta h2 {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }
    .qms-cta-pricing {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
        margin: 0 0 8px;
    }
    .qms-cta-sep {
        margin: 0 10px;
        color: var(--text-light);
    }
    .qms-cta-note {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin: 0 0 20px;
    }
    .qms-cta-buttons {
        justify-content: center;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .qms-features-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .qms-features-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .qms-params-list > div {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 4px;
        }
    }
</style>
